'環境署資料記錄比尤德利塞文河北區於2004年、南區於2006年完成，結合混凝土牆、可拆擋板及抽水站；2020年維護公告特別涉及地面滲漏和接縫重封。波士頓主要防洪閘及相連工程於2020年十二月完成，但不等於所有後續港口工程都在該年竣工。工兵團官方目錄核對2022年防洪牆手冊的版本與範圍，本課未把取得受限的全文條文當已逐條核實。數值均為獨立假設，用來說明力學與資料需求。~Environment Agency records identify Severnside North completion in 2004 and South in 2006, combining concrete walls, removable barriers and pumps. Its 2020 maintenance release specifically addresses ground seepage and resealing. Boston’s primary gate and associated works completed in December 2020, not every later port-related component. The Corps official catalogue verifies the 2022 floodwall manual edition and scope; restricted full text is not represented as clause-by-clause verification. Numerical examples are independent assumptions explaining mechanics and evidence needs.',
